      83.83,
      144.49,
      382.06,
      155.56
    ],
    "text": "And whereas, the need to fill the vacancy this caused has been identified;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.83,
      168.49,
      539.92,
      215.56
    ],
    "text": "Now therefore, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, reposinggreat trust and confidence in his prudence, ability and fidelity , do in pursuance of the provisions of section 3 of theCommissions of Inquiry Act, by these presents, appoint Piyasena Ranasinghe Esquire, Judge of the High Court to be aCommissioner of the Commission of Inquiry constituted in terms of the Warrant referred to above.",
